WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 6]

01:34.900 --> 01:36.520
Mr. Xin, we'll follow your will.

01:36.540 --> 01:37.440
Don't say that!

01:37.460 --> 01:38.880
Don't just follow my will!

01:38.900 --> 01:39.880
Mr. Xin.

01:39.900 --> 01:40.440
Don't do that!

01:40.460 --> 01:41.440
Mr. Xin.

01:41.460 --> 01:43.780
I can't make the call here!

01:44.060 --> 01:45.880
This is too much of a coincidence.

01:45.900 --> 01:47.780
He said they changed their schedule.

01:47.960 --> 01:49.340
He changed his schedule,

01:49.540 --> 01:51.220
and it clashes with mine?

01:51.460 --> 01:53.600
Your Highness, although your carriage

01:53.620 --> 01:56.220
represents the honor of your kingdom,

01:56.340 --> 01:57.680
in my opinion,

01:57.700 --> 01:59.320
we'll be a family anyway.

01:59.340 --> 02:00.960
You don't need to care about this.

02:00.980 --> 02:02.220
We can discuss this.

02:04.780 --> 02:07.980
As to whether we should give in or not,
Your Highness may make the call.

02:15.620 --> 02:17.580
As a royal of Qi,

02:17.740 --> 02:21.020
everything I do represents Qi.

02:21.780 --> 02:23.420
I may suffer,

02:24.060 --> 02:27.140
but I mustn't let my state be disgraced.

02:30.220 --> 02:31.540
I won't give in!

02:32.180 --> 02:33.300
She won't?

02:33.660 --> 02:35.660
I already did my best.

02:35.860 --> 02:38.700
What should we do
about His Highness, then?

02:39.500 --> 02:42.020
Just let him wait, then.

02:42.780 --> 02:44.340
But that's the prince!

02:44.340 --> 02:46.100
That's the Princess Consort-to-be.

02:48.220 --> 02:49.540
Mr. Xin,

02:49.780 --> 02:50.860
why don't you

02:51.060 --> 02:52.820
tell the Ministry of Rites to get ready?

03:04.660 --> 03:05.740
Depart!

06:51.780 --> 06:54.460
Greetings, Your Highness. I'm Fan Xian.

07:56.180 --> 07:57.980
I've heard of your name before.

07:58.900 --> 08:00.780
I'm flattered.

08:01.820 --> 08:03.740
You dare to block
the prince's path, huh?

08:03.820 --> 08:05.100
You're pretty bold.

08:05.580 --> 08:07.220
But that was stupid of you.

08:09.140 --> 08:10.220
Your Highness,

08:10.580 --> 08:12.300
I didn't want to do this either.

08:12.580 --> 08:14.340
I had no choice.

08:15.500 --> 08:16.680
Explain yourself.

08:16.700 --> 08:18.480
I have a frail body.

08:18.500 --> 08:19.560
Heading south all the way,

08:19.580 --> 08:21.660
I've experienced
some acclimatization issues.

08:22.140 --> 08:23.660
Your Highness,

08:25.020 --> 08:27.340
do you want me to wait outside

08:27.820 --> 08:29.420
instead of entering the city?

08:35.620 --> 08:39.020
Your Highness,
is that explanation good enough?

08:56.900 --> 08:58.780
You're pretty bold indeed.

09:01.500 --> 09:03.260
Your Highness, why should I panic

09:03.380 --> 09:04.660
when it's your affair?

09:06.260 --> 09:07.740
What if I want you to make way for me?

09:07.740 --> 09:11.140
If so, I can only die
to compensate you, Your Highness.

09:11.320 --> 09:13.260
I was the one who wanted to enter
the city as soon as possible.

09:13.260 --> 09:14.980
This has nothing to do with Mr. Fan.

09:19.580 --> 09:21.870
[First Prince, Li Chengru]
You're pretty bold too.

09:28.740 --> 09:29.900
Fan Xian,

09:30.380 --> 09:32.400
do you think I don't dare to kill you?

09:32.420 --> 09:34.180
Of course not, Your Highness.

10:30.780 --> 10:31.960
The horses are alarmed!

10:31.980 --> 10:32.960
Get out of the way!

10:32.980 --> 10:34.380
Get out of the way!

10:39.940 --> 10:40.960
The horses are alarmed!

10:40.980 --> 10:42.060
Get out of the way!

10:51.780 --> 10:53.900
Gao Da! Protect Mr. Fan!

11:33.220 --> 11:34.540
Excellent skills.

11:34.620 --> 11:36.120
Your Highness, you flatter me.

11:36.140 --> 11:39.540
Since the horses were alarmed,
it's our duty to keep them in check.

11:40.260 --> 11:42.420
The horses are dead!

11:42.780 --> 11:43.860
Hurry!

11:44.500 --> 11:45.580
Hurry!

11:47.660 --> 11:48.600
This...

11:48.620 --> 11:49.600
Gao, you...

11:49.620 --> 11:50.100
No way.

11:50.100 --> 11:51.480
I didn't even unsheathe my sword.

11:51.500 --> 11:53.500
How did the horse die?

11:53.820 --> 11:55.240
How can you stop a warhorse's stampede

11:55.260 --> 11:56.880
without using some force?

11:56.900 --> 11:57.980
You!

12:00.320 --> 12:02.760
You're slaying my warhorses
after I returned from my expedition.

12:02.780 --> 12:04.740
Mr. Fan, you're something else indeed.

12:04.860 --> 12:07.060
I've led our troops for many years.

12:07.300 --> 12:09.720
I never expected the imperial court
to receive us like this.

12:09.740 --> 12:10.480
This is an accident.

12:10.500 --> 12:12.400
But since you're
Wan'er's future husband,

12:12.420 --> 12:14.020
I won't pursue it against you.

12:15.500 --> 12:16.820
Give him to me.

12:17.580 --> 12:19.240
I'll compensate you with new horses.

12:20.020 --> 12:21.100
Gao!

12:21.740 --> 12:22.820
Fan Xian!

12:24.260 --> 12:25.740
You'd better think carefully.

12:25.780 --> 12:26.860
Mr. Fan, this isn't worth it.

12:26.860 --> 12:27.940
Shut up!

12:29.140 --> 12:31.620
I'll bear the responsibility for his mistake.

12:36.900 --> 12:38.280
I said that.

12:38.300 --> 12:39.900
Stop causing trouble for Mr. Fan.

12:57.220 --> 12:59.780
The Crown Prince has arrived!

13:13.925 --> 13:17.020
[The Capital]

13:21.220 --> 13:23.900
Greetings, Your Highness.

13:40.220 --> 13:42.220
Greetings, Your Highness.

13:42.220 --> 13:44.260
Brother, spare the formalities.

13:56.380 --> 13:57.460
Chengru!

13:58.140 --> 13:59.640
Greetings, Crown Prince.

13:59.660 --> 14:01.200
You're my eldest brother.

14:01.220 --> 14:02.740
I don't deserve your bow.

14:04.580 --> 14:06.620
You've been on an expedition
all these years.

14:06.900 --> 14:07.880
You've become thinner.

14:07.900 --> 14:09.180
That doesn't matter.

14:09.220 --> 14:11.140
I feel better when I'm outside.

14:11.300 --> 14:13.720
I wouldn't even come back
if it weren't for the imperial edict.

14:13.740 --> 14:15.240
You have to come back.

14:15.260 --> 14:17.540
Do you know how much I miss you?

14:18.780 --> 14:19.860
Chengru,

14:20.900 --> 14:21.980
give me a hug.

14:28.220 --> 14:29.260
We're right at our doorstep.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.740
Why aren't you coming inside?

14:31.980 --> 14:33.600
It's not that I don't want to go inside.

14:33.620 --> 14:35.500
It's just that someone
is blocking my path.

14:36.860 --> 14:38.340
Who dares to block your path?

14:39.780 --> 14:40.860
Hey.

14:45.500 --> 14:46.900
Why is it you again?

14:47.260 --> 14:49.480
Don't you know that obstructing
my brother is a heinous crime?

14:49.500 --> 14:51.140
Your Highness, I'm not that bold.

14:51.140 --> 14:52.000
But you see,

14:52.020 --> 14:54.780
the Crown Princess of Northern Qi
is part of our convoy too.

14:55.380 --> 14:57.580
She said she was facing some
acclimatization issues.

14:57.580 --> 14:59.080
She wanted to enter
the city earlier to rest.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.420
Am I right, Your Highness?

15:02.260 --> 15:04.260
That is indeed my will.

15:08.500 --> 15:10.540
Your Highness, please be patient.

15:10.620 --> 15:12.120
Just stay seated.

15:12.140 --> 15:13.400
Since your warhorse died,

15:13.420 --> 15:15.180
I'll compensate you with one.

15:15.260 --> 15:16.400
It's not cheap.

15:16.420 --> 15:17.500
I...

15:18.620 --> 15:20.500
As a royal of Qi,

15:20.620 --> 15:22.660
I should have a sense of responsibility.

15:23.140 --> 15:24.640
You're wealthier than me.

15:24.660 --> 15:25.760
I can't afford it myself.

15:25.780 --> 15:27.500
Mother is paying for this too.

15:31.140 --> 15:32.420
You may tell me

15:32.540 --> 15:34.140
how much it costs later.

15:35.380 --> 15:36.460
Okay.

15:36.500 --> 15:38.180
I'll seek you out in private later.

15:51.140 --> 15:52.220
Chengru,

15:53.020 --> 15:54.100
Her Highness

15:54.860 --> 15:56.900
is your future consort

15:57.140 --> 15:58.900
and my future sister-in-law.

15:59.740 --> 16:01.900
But Fan Xian is stuck
in the middle here.

16:02.100 --> 16:03.900
It's hard for him to act.

16:04.380 --> 16:05.000
But of course,

16:05.020 --> 16:07.020
if you wish to vent your frustrations,

16:07.140 --> 16:09.620
as your brother,
I'll surely teach him a lesson.

16:09.940 --> 16:11.420
Your Highness,
since you already said so,

16:11.420 --> 16:13.000
why would I hold it against him?

16:13.020 --> 16:15.420
That's right. Don't put him
on the same level as you.

16:17.360 --> 16:18.920
Chengru, it's been so long
since you came back.

16:18.920 --> 16:20.300
This should be
your first time seeing him.

16:20.300 --> 16:22.780
Chengru, let me
introduce him officially.

16:23.020 --> 16:26.120
This is the young talent
of the Qing State,

16:26.140 --> 16:27.220
Fan Xian.

16:27.980 --> 16:30.300
Greetings, Your Highness.

16:31.620 --> 16:32.640
I know him.

16:32.660 --> 16:34.180
He's Wan'er's husband.

16:34.380 --> 16:35.460
That's right.

16:35.620 --> 16:39.060
Now, he's still helping Mr. Chen out.

16:40.060 --> 16:42.220
Inspector of
the Imperial Inspectorate, huh?

16:42.500 --> 16:43.960
That's a high position.

16:43.980 --> 16:45.120
Chengru,

16:45.140 --> 16:48.280
Wan'er is just like our sister, right?

16:48.300 --> 16:50.500
You should let
your future brother-in-law off

16:51.420 --> 16:53.800
on account of Wan'er.

16:53.820 --> 16:55.280
Your Highness, did you actually think

16:55.300 --> 16:57.260
that I was angry
because he blocked my path?

16:57.780 --> 16:59.240
If so, Chengru,
what are you angry about?

16:59.260 --> 17:00.940
Marriage is a huge deal.

17:01.140 --> 17:02.300
But now,

17:02.740 --> 17:04.420
Father said the one could take over

17:04.420 --> 17:06.240
the Imperial Treasury
as long as he married Wan'er.

17:06.260 --> 17:07.800
He appeared after that.

17:07.820 --> 17:09.840
I don't know if he intends
to marry Wan'er for her sake

17:09.860 --> 17:12.100
or for the countless wealth
that he'll inherit.

17:13.020 --> 17:14.060
Naturally, it's because of her.

17:14.060 --> 17:15.100
Everyone will say the same thing.

17:15.120 --> 17:16.320
Your Highness, you said this first.

17:16.340 --> 17:18.100
I don't want the Imperial Treasury either.

17:18.100 --> 17:20.120
However, I can't go
against the imperial edict.

17:21.540 --> 17:23.060
Father's edict

17:23.100 --> 17:24.740
was not well thought out indeed.

17:29.260 --> 17:31.340
Although you two had never met before,

17:31.540 --> 17:32.660
according to my understanding

17:32.660 --> 17:34.300
of your characters,

17:34.460 --> 17:36.820
I'm sure you two
can become great friends.

17:38.580 --> 17:40.020
It's getting late.

17:40.300 --> 17:42.020
Chengze and Chengping

17:42.100 --> 17:44.220
are waiting for you, Chengru.

17:44.580 --> 17:47.180
Why don't we chat inside?

17:47.700 --> 17:48.960
If so, Your Highness,

17:48.980 --> 17:51.700
how should we decide
the order of entrance, then?

17:58.100 --> 17:59.480
You came at a great timing.

17:59.500 --> 18:00.560
Indeed.

18:00.580 --> 18:02.580
Your Highness,
you should make the call here.

18:11.940 --> 18:13.020
Chengze,

18:13.420 --> 18:15.460
isn't Chengru going to argue
with the convoy?

18:15.480 --> 18:17.160
Shouldn't we go
and mediate the argument?

18:17.180 --> 18:18.960
We're here to receive him.

18:18.980 --> 18:20.540
We're not mediators.

18:27.180 --> 18:28.720
If so, why did
the Crown Prince go there?

18:28.740 --> 18:30.580
The Crown Prince is different from us.

18:33.180 --> 18:34.480
Who would he help, then?

18:34.500 --> 18:35.580
Him?

18:36.020 --> 18:37.340
He'll help both,

18:37.860 --> 18:39.540
yet not help them at the same time.

18:40.780 --> 18:42.580
It must be tough on him, then.

18:48.860 --> 18:50.580
It's tough enough to survive.

18:54.100 --> 18:55.180
They're here!

19:09.820 --> 19:11.880
Why did they enter the city
at the same time?

19:12.180 --> 19:14.220
He did a great job as a mediator.

19:49.780 --> 19:50.860
Chengru.

19:57.540 --> 19:59.860
It's been so long. You've grown taller.

20:00.120 --> 20:02.280
Chengru, I want to be
as tall as you in the future.

20:02.300 --> 20:03.700
I want to go on expeditions too.

20:04.060 --> 20:05.500
I'm glad to hear that.

20:09.540 --> 20:11.980
Long time no see.
You've lost some weight.

20:13.860 --> 20:15.580
That's what I said

20:15.980 --> 20:17.540
when I saw him.

20:34.860 --> 20:36.460
Let me take a good look at you.

20:38.100 --> 20:39.640
Your body is much sturdier now.

20:39.660 --> 20:41.560
I should've prepared some gifts for you

20:41.580 --> 20:43.660
had I known that you
were coming back together with Chengru.

20:43.660 --> 20:45.360
Your Highness, you're too courteous.

20:45.780 --> 20:47.940
I've already accepted your gift

20:48.420 --> 20:49.520
on my way back.

20:49.540 --> 20:50.740
Really?

20:51.060 --> 20:52.540
I actually forgot about it.

21:04.220 --> 21:05.320
Smile!

21:05.340 --> 21:06.560
But don't worry.

21:06.580 --> 21:09.100
There are better gifts awaiting you.

21:09.180 --> 21:11.540
If so, I'll look forward to them.

21:14.540 --> 21:17.780
Chengze is considerate indeed.

21:19.660 --> 21:21.800
Your Highness,
your merit knows no bounds.

21:21.820 --> 21:23.940
Also, you managed to turn the tide.

21:28.420 --> 21:29.820
Is Chengze mocking me?

21:30.260 --> 21:32.260
I was praising you.

21:35.980 --> 21:37.500
Chengze, you flatter me.

21:38.540 --> 21:40.860
You are?

21:42.260 --> 21:43.500
It's you?

21:52.580 --> 21:54.780
Who are you?

22:00.820 --> 22:02.580
So, this must be Prince Chengping.

22:05.820 --> 22:07.100
I'm not dreaming, aren't I?

22:07.260 --> 22:08.440
Is he real?

22:08.460 --> 22:09.700
Why are you hiding?

22:10.060 --> 22:11.780
He knocked me out before.

22:12.060 --> 22:12.960
Are you sure?

22:12.980 --> 22:15.280
Yes. I thought it was a dream.

22:15.300 --> 22:16.540
So, it was true.

22:20.260 --> 22:22.020
How dare you assault a prince?

22:25.820 --> 22:28.440
Your Highness, may I know
where I knocked you out, then?

22:28.460 --> 22:30.440
It's in Bao...

22:30.460 --> 22:31.540
What?

22:32.500 --> 22:33.240
Please go ahead.

22:33.260 --> 22:34.940
No one dares to obstruct you here.

22:37.740 --> 22:38.820
Just say it out.

22:38.980 --> 22:40.060
I'm here for you.

22:42.840 --> 22:43.920
Bao...

22:44.580 --> 22:46.020
I'm sorry.

22:46.660 --> 22:47.860
I remembered wrongly.

22:47.880 --> 22:49.220
You remembered wrongly?

22:50.780 --> 22:52.340
It was a nightmare.

22:52.700 --> 22:55.000
If so,
that means we'd never met before, right?

22:55.020 --> 22:55.960
That's right.

22:55.980 --> 22:57.500
This is our first encounter.

22:57.780 --> 22:59.580
Your Highness, you scared me.

23:00.020 --> 23:01.300
Are you sure about that?

23:01.940 --> 23:02.920
Yes.

23:02.940 --> 23:04.780
I always stayed inside the palace.

23:04.820 --> 23:06.580
I didn't have a chance to meet Mr. Fan.

23:11.260 --> 23:13.780
Aren't you two
going to ask him about it?

23:17.020 --> 23:18.340
Didn't he say it already?

23:18.940 --> 23:20.580
He said he saw him in his dream.

23:21.820 --> 23:22.900
All right.

23:23.700 --> 23:25.240
I shall take my leave first.

23:25.260 --> 23:26.240
Why the rush?

23:26.260 --> 23:27.360
It's been so long since we met.

23:27.380 --> 23:28.460
Aren't you going to chat with us?

23:28.460 --> 23:29.460
I'm bent on returning home.

23:29.460 --> 23:32.100
It's been so long since I came back.
I did miss both my home and Wan'er.

23:32.700 --> 23:34.340
It's been tough on you, huh?

23:37.500 --> 23:39.220
His Majesty has an oral edict.

23:39.300 --> 23:44.700
Fan Xian and the princes
are to see him in the palace.

23:46.020 --> 23:47.500
Fan Xian?

23:47.860 --> 23:49.300
He's in such a hurry to see you?

23:49.940 --> 23:52.460
Maybe because
I deceived the ruler just now.

23:54.160 --> 23:56.000
Chengru, you can take your time
to get used to him.

23:56.020 --> 23:57.780
This is Mr. Fan

23:58.020 --> 23:59.620
for you.

24:12.060 --> 24:13.140
Chengru.

24:13.740 --> 24:14.260
Your Highness.

24:14.260 --> 24:15.020
Your Highness.

24:15.040 --> 24:16.060
I already told you this before.

24:16.060 --> 24:17.860
We're a family. Spare the formalities.

24:18.780 --> 24:19.980
Hello, Chengze.

24:20.660 --> 24:23.780
What was his name again? Fan Xian?

24:23.860 --> 24:25.240
Wasn't he together with you just now?

24:25.260 --> 24:26.640
His Majesty summoned him.

24:26.660 --> 24:28.240
The banquet will start soon.

24:28.260 --> 24:29.480
Father wishes to see him alone?

24:29.500 --> 24:31.300
I'm afraid he'll be severely punished.

24:32.260 --> 24:33.160
But why?

24:33.180 --> 24:35.520
Fan Xian faked his death
on his way back from his diplomatic trip.

24:35.540 --> 24:37.000
It's a huge deal.

24:37.020 --> 24:38.560
It has to be concluded somehow.

24:38.580 --> 24:40.800
I heard that he had no choice
but to fake his death

24:40.820 --> 24:42.220
due to Sigu Jian's threat.

24:42.740 --> 24:43.840
Although that's the case,

24:43.860 --> 24:44.940
he still deceived the ruler.

24:44.960 --> 24:46.280
These are two different matters.

24:46.300 --> 24:48.300
Chengze, you
are taking this too seriously.

24:48.460 --> 24:50.080
His opponent
was a Grandmaster, after all.

24:50.100 --> 24:51.540
I suppose he can be excused.

24:54.540 --> 24:57.180
Your Highness, are you saying
that everyone can deceive the ruler

24:57.180 --> 24:59.340
as long as they have a valid reason?

24:59.820 --> 25:01.640
I didn't say that.

25:01.660 --> 25:02.920
I was just saying.

25:02.940 --> 25:04.380
Don't be scared.

25:07.580 --> 25:10.440
Do not discuss state affairs in private.

25:10.460 --> 25:12.300
His Majesty has arrived!

25:15.060 --> 25:17.020
- Greetings, Father.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

25:18.260 --> 25:19.460
Have a seat.

25:24.980 --> 25:26.000
Li Chengru,

25:26.020 --> 25:27.920
you look pretty energetic.

25:27.940 --> 25:29.960
It's been many years.
Father, how's your health?

25:29.980 --> 25:31.060
I won't die yet.

25:31.220 --> 25:32.300
Have a seat.

25:44.940 --> 25:46.300
Your Majesty,

25:46.420 --> 25:47.860
thank you for the rods.

25:49.020 --> 25:50.180
Have a seat.

25:54.260 --> 25:55.820
Your Majesty,

25:55.980 --> 25:58.020
thank you for granting me a seat.

25:59.780 --> 26:01.180
Be careful.

26:02.500 --> 26:05.300
Today, we shall have a meal together.

26:05.860 --> 26:09.400
We can also hear
about the bizarre incidents

26:09.420 --> 26:11.780
Fan Xian encountered
during his trip to Northern Qi.

26:13.180 --> 26:14.080
Fan Xian.

26:14.100 --> 26:15.340
Yes, Your Majesty.

26:15.700 --> 26:17.040
For my trip to Northern Qi,

26:17.060 --> 26:19.780
I managed to bring Yan Bingyun
back to the Capital successfully.

26:21.020 --> 26:22.440
As for Northern Qi,

26:22.460 --> 26:24.060
Shen Zhong died by Shang Shanhu's spear.

26:24.060 --> 26:26.180
The political situation
is somewhat unstable.

26:27.300 --> 26:28.980
I'm only concerned

26:29.020 --> 26:31.020
about the temple.

26:37.820 --> 26:39.780
Before Xiao En died, he revealed

26:41.340 --> 26:43.200
that the temple did exist.

26:43.220 --> 26:45.620
It's in the far northern lands,
amid the snowfields.

26:46.060 --> 26:47.520
Does the temple truly exist?

26:47.540 --> 26:48.940
Xiao En said it did.

26:50.860 --> 26:52.940
However, we'll only see
whether it exists or not

26:54.180 --> 26:56.700
when we see it for ourselves.

26:56.780 --> 26:57.920
The far northern lands?

26:57.940 --> 26:59.740
We have to pass through Northern Qi.

27:00.020 --> 27:01.300
It's inconvenient.

27:01.660 --> 27:03.780
It'll be convenient

27:04.020 --> 27:05.620
when Northern Qi doesn't exist.

27:08.100 --> 27:09.980
Your Majesty has the world in your palm.

27:10.020 --> 27:11.860
Northern Qi will be ours in the future.

27:13.340 --> 27:14.420
Fan Xian,

27:15.020 --> 27:16.160
what else is there?

27:16.180 --> 27:17.500
Your Majesty,

27:18.300 --> 27:20.020
there's actually one more thing.

27:20.700 --> 27:21.780
Speak.

27:26.580 --> 27:28.340
Before Shen Zhong died, he told me

27:28.340 --> 27:29.940
that Northern Qi's
Embroidered Uniform Guards

27:29.940 --> 27:32.340
had been engaged in smuggling deals
with the Qing State all along.

27:32.340 --> 27:33.920
And the perpetrators here

27:33.940 --> 27:35.540
are Eldest Princess

27:36.020 --> 27:37.540
and Prince Chengze.

27:43.940 --> 27:45.760
The family banquet
in His Majesty's study room

27:45.780 --> 27:48.540
has started.

27:49.420 --> 27:51.020
Did Fan Xian not leave?

27:51.060 --> 27:53.540
Your Majesty, Mr. Fan
remained at the banquet.

28:05.460 --> 28:07.000
The fire was extinguished!

28:07.020 --> 28:08.540
Your Majesty, please spare us!

28:15.860 --> 28:17.560
A subject was offered a place
at the family banquet

28:17.560 --> 28:19.240
[Empress of Qing State]

28:19.260 --> 28:21.860
while I, the empress, have none?

28:24.340 --> 28:25.740
Family banquet, huh?

28:31.820 --> 28:33.300
What did they chat about?

28:33.540 --> 28:37.560
Your Majesty, Fan Xian talked about
Prince Chengze and Eldest Princess.

28:37.580 --> 28:40.620
He said they colluded with Northern Qi
for their illegal dealings.

28:45.500 --> 28:47.020
Did he say that in public?

28:47.740 --> 28:50.260
Yes. All of the princes were there.

28:55.500 --> 28:57.580
How did His Majesty react, then?

29:13.140 --> 29:14.740
Your Majesty, please be appeased.

29:15.420 --> 29:17.300
According to my understanding,

29:17.340 --> 29:19.080
Chengze would never do such a thing.

29:19.100 --> 29:20.980
I'm sure...

29:21.780 --> 29:23.240
I'm sure there's a misunderstanding!

29:23.260 --> 29:24.380
Your Majesty.

29:25.220 --> 29:26.700
I will acknowledge my crime.

29:26.980 --> 29:28.480
Aunt and I have never done anything

29:28.500 --> 29:30.300
to let the Qing State down.

29:30.540 --> 29:32.240
But an individual like Mr. Fan

29:32.260 --> 29:33.640
would never say such a thing

29:33.660 --> 29:35.480
if he didn't have any concrete evidence.

29:35.500 --> 29:38.480
Maybe I did something wrong.

29:38.500 --> 29:41.020
That's why Mr. Fan had
a misunderstanding with me.

29:41.060 --> 29:42.300
Mr. Fan?

29:42.420 --> 29:43.280
Mr. Fan.

29:43.300 --> 29:44.380
Fan Xian,

29:45.820 --> 29:49.260
you accused Eldest Princess
and Second Prince in public.

29:49.780 --> 29:51.320
Do you have any witnesses or evidence?

29:51.340 --> 29:52.720
Shen Zhong is my witness.

29:52.740 --> 29:53.720
Where is he, then?

29:53.740 --> 29:54.700
Although he's dead,

29:54.700 --> 29:57.040
deeds that have been done can be
traced back in one way or another.

29:57.060 --> 30:00.780
The witness is dead,
and you don't have any evidence.

30:01.060 --> 30:04.020
How dare you accuse Second Prince?

30:05.540 --> 30:07.220
Who do you think you are?

30:13.300 --> 30:15.460
I'm an inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

30:16.460 --> 30:19.220
I possess the sword of justice,
and my duty is to rid the world of evil.

30:20.980 --> 30:21.940
Come again?

30:21.960 --> 30:23.500
I'm an inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate.

30:23.500 --> 30:26.380
I possess the sword of justice,
and my duty is to rid the world of evil.

30:34.900 --> 30:36.145
[Inspector]

30:54.500 --> 30:55.580
Father,

30:55.660 --> 30:56.800
Fan Xian is infuriating indeed.

30:56.820 --> 30:58.860
He even obstructed my horse
outside of the city gate.

30:58.880 --> 31:00.940
So, he acts in the same way
even when he sees you.

31:01.420 --> 31:03.620
Seems like he was born with this temper.

31:03.780 --> 31:04.680
Please be appeased.

31:04.700 --> 31:07.700
That's right, Your Majesty.
Please be appeased.

31:07.880 --> 31:09.500
Your Majesty, please be appeased.

31:11.860 --> 31:13.500
Father, please be appeased.

31:15.300 --> 31:17.300
Do you guys have
anything else to tell me?

31:20.780 --> 31:21.840
Your Majesty,

31:21.860 --> 31:25.040
actually, I have a joyous event

31:25.060 --> 31:27.020
that I wish for you to consider.

31:27.300 --> 31:28.020
Joyous event?

31:28.020 --> 31:28.480
That's right.

31:28.500 --> 31:29.820
What is it?

31:30.500 --> 31:32.720
Although Fan Xian did commit mistakes,

31:32.740 --> 31:34.800
he did a great job
as our diplomat to Northern Qi.

31:34.820 --> 31:36.760
In addition, he's exceptionally gifted.

31:36.780 --> 31:37.720
From that,

31:37.740 --> 31:39.680
we can see that the Fan family
is well-educated.

31:39.700 --> 31:41.520
Their daughter, Fan Ruoruo,

31:41.540 --> 31:43.180
is known in the Capital for her talents.

31:43.180 --> 31:45.700
And she's elegant and virtuous as well.

31:45.780 --> 31:48.480
Li Hongcheng, also known
as Prince Jing, is an honest person.

31:48.500 --> 31:49.260
And he's not married yet.

31:49.260 --> 31:51.800
In addition, he has admired
Fan Ruoruo for a long time.

31:51.820 --> 31:53.780
Since Fan Xian is already
engaged to Wan'er,

31:53.780 --> 31:56.000
why don't we hold another joyous event

31:56.020 --> 31:57.400
and foster a stronger bond?

31:57.420 --> 32:00.100
We can also form
another couple with this.

32:00.660 --> 32:02.700
Ruoruo isn't in a rush to get married.

32:04.220 --> 32:06.780
You're good at using
unexpected tactics, aren't you?

32:07.540 --> 32:09.560
I'll permit the marriage.

32:09.580 --> 32:10.280
Your Majesty!

32:10.300 --> 32:11.540
Besides,

32:12.540 --> 32:14.800
Fan Xian has rendered huge merit
for his trip to Northern Qi.

32:14.820 --> 32:17.300
I shall grant him the title
of first-class baron as well.

32:24.740 --> 32:26.680
Since you like joyous events so much,

32:26.700 --> 32:29.540
I'll grant you a marriage too.

32:30.820 --> 32:35.260
Ye Zhong's daughter, Ye Ling'er,
is a great partner for you.

32:35.340 --> 32:37.240
I shall grant her to you.

32:37.260 --> 32:39.000
But I do not know Ye Ling'er well.

32:39.020 --> 32:41.540
Enough. You guys can continue.

32:47.260 --> 32:48.340
I...

32:49.780 --> 32:51.040
Yes, Father.

32:51.060 --> 32:52.300
Yes, Father!

32:54.780 --> 32:56.040
Your Majesty,

32:56.060 --> 32:58.720
for the sake of our people
and the law of Qing State,

32:58.740 --> 33:00.800
please investigate
Eldest Princess, Li Yunrui,

33:00.820 --> 33:02.780
and Second Prince, Li Chengze!

33:03.700 --> 33:05.240
You don't have any concrete evidence!

33:05.260 --> 33:06.420
These are just your accusations!

33:06.420 --> 33:08.600
There's no evidence
without an investigation!

33:13.700 --> 33:16.220
I should've punished you more harshly.

33:17.660 --> 33:19.100
This case has caused countless deaths!

33:19.100 --> 33:20.240
Their sins are unpardonable!

33:20.260 --> 33:22.740
Your Majesty, please investigate them!

33:37.420 --> 33:38.500
Eat up.

33:48.500 --> 33:49.620
Congratulations.

34:24.340 --> 34:25.820
Wasn't he punished?

34:25.880 --> 34:27.280
How did he recover from that?

34:27.300 --> 34:28.820
It was just an act.

34:28.980 --> 34:30.580
They did it in front of us.

34:30.620 --> 34:31.680
But why?

34:31.700 --> 34:34.380
They're giving an out
for his crime of deceiving the ruler.

34:35.540 --> 34:37.260
But His Majesty

34:38.620 --> 34:40.580
favors Fan Xian too much.

35:13.300 --> 35:14.460
Don't give up yet.

35:14.780 --> 35:17.060
After all, Chengze and Aunt
are close relatives.

35:17.300 --> 35:19.220
Actually, I'm already used to it.

35:19.820 --> 35:21.140
All these years,

35:21.540 --> 35:24.580
His Majesty has always
favored him more than me.

35:27.900 --> 35:30.300
He made Yuan Meng take charge
of Baoyue Pleasure House

35:31.180 --> 35:32.940
just for that moment.

35:33.980 --> 35:35.620
The marriage

35:36.900 --> 35:38.380
was a low blow indeed.

35:39.140 --> 35:41.780
Your brother is the owner
of Baoyue Pleasure House.

35:42.060 --> 35:44.120
And now, Yuan Meng,
the person in charge,

35:44.140 --> 35:46.100
has become
your brother-in-law's mistress.

35:46.180 --> 35:49.660
He did ruin the reputation
of the Fan family.

35:52.980 --> 35:55.040
He's trying to drag me into this mess

35:55.060 --> 35:56.500
by force.

36:00.740 --> 36:02.460
Don't submit to fate yet.

36:06.580 --> 36:08.500
His Majesty was right about something.

36:08.860 --> 36:10.500
I need to have concrete evidence.

36:16.580 --> 36:17.660
Your Highness,

36:17.780 --> 36:19.400
how's your investigation on Shijia Town?

36:19.420 --> 36:20.780
Did you receive any news?

36:21.100 --> 36:23.440
All smuggled goods must be stockpiled
and then transported from there.

36:23.460 --> 36:25.620
As long as we
can find proof of collusion

36:25.620 --> 36:28.680
between Chengze and Shijia Town,
this case will be 80 percent confirmed.

36:33.460 --> 36:34.540
What's wrong?

36:36.980 --> 36:38.300
Shijia Town,

36:40.060 --> 36:41.140
it's gone.

36:44.940 --> 36:46.620
What do you mean?

36:47.060 --> 36:50.588
[Shijia Town]

36:54.620 --> 36:56.780
Don't tell me no one survived?

37:01.740 --> 37:03.500
When I was there,

37:05.260 --> 37:07.100
the town was already reduced to ashes.

37:07.540 --> 37:08.860
No one survived.

37:11.980 --> 37:14.420
Chengze was ruthless.

37:15.900 --> 37:17.580
Now that the village is burned down,

37:17.940 --> 37:19.900
the leads on his crime
have been cut off.

37:20.220 --> 37:23.060
The thing is, so many
innocent people had to die!

37:25.780 --> 37:27.260
The town is gone.

37:27.740 --> 37:29.420
We need to demand an explanation.

37:30.300 --> 37:31.740
It was a fire accident.

37:33.620 --> 37:34.780
That's it?

37:49.860 --> 37:52.300
He's truly abusing his power here.

37:56.540 --> 37:57.860
Calm down.

37:59.380 --> 38:01.260
Now that we have no concrete evidence

38:01.340 --> 38:03.180
and His Majesty is siding with Chengze,

38:03.540 --> 38:05.960
what you can do now
is to readjust your mental state

38:05.980 --> 38:08.020
and try to please His Majesty
as much as you can.

38:08.220 --> 38:11.340
As for the rest,
we can act when the opportunity arises.

38:11.900 --> 38:13.060
And

38:14.260 --> 38:16.080
regarding your position
as the inspector,

38:16.100 --> 38:17.740
we have to get it back somehow.

38:17.780 --> 38:20.260
This position is vital to our plan.

38:24.380 --> 38:26.660
Your Highness, Her Majesty
requests your presence.

38:39.220 --> 38:40.240
Don't give up.

38:40.260 --> 38:42.620
With our combined effort,
we'll make progress slowly.

39:01.100 --> 39:03.300
Mother, I've arrived.

39:04.940 --> 39:06.140
Come inside.

39:46.220 --> 39:47.300
Greetings,

39:48.300 --> 39:49.660
Mother.

39:50.420 --> 39:51.820
Spare the formalities.

39:52.140 --> 39:53.740
There are no outsiders here.

40:06.420 --> 40:08.660
I have to observe
these rites all day long.

40:08.780 --> 40:11.260
Even my body is stiff now.

40:20.860 --> 40:21.940
Mother,

40:22.340 --> 40:25.060
Chengze walks barefoot every day.

40:25.260 --> 40:26.780
Is it comfortable?

40:49.980 --> 40:51.460
It does feel great.

40:54.340 --> 40:56.340
Mother, are you still
afraid of the dark?

40:57.100 --> 40:58.660
I've always been this way.

41:03.380 --> 41:06.120
Why don't we
get you another imperial physician?

41:06.140 --> 41:07.500
It's pointless.

41:08.700 --> 41:10.100
In this world,

41:11.580 --> 41:13.420
ailments of the heart are hard to cure.

41:14.780 --> 41:17.180
Even so, you can't just drink every day.

41:22.180 --> 41:23.300
What?

41:24.860 --> 41:26.740
Are you here to lecture me?

41:31.740 --> 41:33.300
I dare not do so.

41:33.540 --> 41:35.180
What I meant was,

41:35.940 --> 41:37.340
this place is too bright.

41:37.460 --> 41:38.900
It hurts my eyes.

41:39.140 --> 41:40.700
You're the crown prince.

41:41.220 --> 41:43.180
You have to behave properly.

41:43.860 --> 41:46.060
After all, many people
have their eyes on you.

41:51.060 --> 41:54.860
Mother, I only dare
to behave as such in front of you.

41:55.260 --> 41:56.940
Even when I'm in the Eastern Palace,

41:57.780 --> 41:59.860
I dare not act recklessly.

42:03.140 --> 42:04.300
Really?

42:07.620 --> 42:09.060
That's what I do every day.

42:10.180 --> 42:11.820
As if I were treading on thin ice.

42:19.260 --> 42:20.780
Did you draw all of these?

42:31.340 --> 42:32.720
Mother, why do you have them?

42:32.740 --> 42:33.640
Were you...

42:33.660 --> 42:35.180
I was just bored.

42:35.980 --> 42:37.920
I was just drawing them for fun.

42:37.940 --> 42:39.940
Is it fun to draw faceless portraits?

42:40.300 --> 42:41.740
Do you want me to ask you

42:41.740 --> 42:43.420
who you were drawing?

42:44.620 --> 42:46.340
You're the crown prince!

42:48.300 --> 42:49.580
I know my fault now.

42:50.740 --> 42:52.860
Mother, I'll remember your words.

42:53.700 --> 42:55.100
I won't draw them again.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
